    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb51c8e1977d8729a4e38aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……『维多利亚英里赛』\n是在春天举办的，古马级后冠赛马娘的\n英里最强决定战。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "04675aaec3ceb79fb4bdae0c5f3968f341a86eda0f6c9d2ff94146d5fe7c7145",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
