    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3186a31fa1558b09b9ff84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而另一方面『伊丽莎白女王杯』是\n秋天举办的，后冠赛马娘的\n中距离最强决定战。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a769e85f7560bdc6736171ba1127153914db592cd8f3a71a555c110b56557c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
